values.assignment:
Literature review — Academic Skills 2

Write, individually, a literature review (3000–3500 words) on one of the topics listed on the course page. Use at least 15 sources, of which at least 10 must be peer-reviewed journal articles, and use Harvard referencing throughout. Submit your review via Moodle by 30 May, 17:00.

The review is graded on a scale of 1–10; a 5.5 or higher is a pass. The lecturer will look at whether:
- the review is of good quality;
- the student is sufficiently critical of the literature;
- a professional attitude is shown;
- the student has clearly made an effort.
